    <h2 class="title-calm">Why robotics?</h2>
    <p>On top of offering an extremely memorable experience, our summer camps provide students with unique, hands-on engineering exposure. You will gain an intuitive understanding on the use of basic and advanced tools and processes, learn to work as part of a real engineering team, and, for FRC Camp students, discover more about an exciting topic of your choice: manufacturing, programming, or design. Students or parents, please don't hesitate to <a href="#contact">reach out</a> if you have any questions to be answered by one of our friendly students or mentors.</p>
    <p>Students who participate in the FRC camp also have an easy pathway to join the team during the school year, where members continue to gain engineering knowledge while helping to make important decisions for the team and the year's competition robot.</p>
